From 8c7871746015459005ad21e8c5dd9ab558f28cdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <teste@hemofilia.org.br>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:37:40 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 36/41] clip: Adds right-click menus for the Clip and dock-app
 tiles.

Like on Window Maker: Right-clicking the Clip opens a menu to switch to
the next or previous workspace, add one, or destroy the last one. A
dock-app's tile opens its menu on a right-click with the window-move
modifier held, or on its border (the dock-app may use the right button
itself): Move it up or down (left or right, on a horizontal Clip), with
the order stored as when dragging it; or terminate the dock-app.

Items that would do nothing are left out. The menus look like the root
menu, open at the pointer, and are kept within the usable area: Not
under the Clip or Dock.
